{"id":"anne_e","lemma":"année","pos":"noun","rank":303,"glosses":["year (period)"],"ipa":"/a.ne/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/03/Fr-ann%C3%A9e.ogg/Fr-ann%C3%A9e.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"années"},"formAudio":{"années":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-ann%C3%A9es.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Combien d'années a cette télé ?","en":"How old is this TV?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/248061","words":[{"g":"how much"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"TV, telly"}]},{"text":"Beaucoup peut arriver en une année.","en":"A lot can happen in a year.","words":[{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to arrive"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Je travaille ici depuis plusieurs années.","en":"I've been working here for many years.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to work","l":"travailler"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"since"},{"g":"several, many, a lot"},null]},{"text":"Attends l'année prochaine.","en":"Wait till next year.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1103007","words":[{"g":"to wait for, to await","l":"attendre"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"upcoming","l":"prochain"}]},{"text":"Je te connais depuis des années.","en":"I've known you for years.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to know","l":"connaître"},{"g":"since"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]}]}